          "id": "${item.id}",
          "loot_description": "<p><p><strong>Blade Form</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Sword <em>&bull; Two-handed &bull; Melee &bull; Martial</em></strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>Accuracy: 【DEX】+【MIG】&bull;　</em></strong><strong><em>Damage: 【HR + 8】Physical</em></strong></p>\n<blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li><em>When you attack with this weapon, If the attack Accuracy check is an <strong>Odd</strong> number or you roll a <strong>Critical Success</strong>, deals <strong>10</strong> bonus damage and the damage is convert to&nbsp;<strong>Fire</strong></em></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Gun Form</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Firearm <em>&bull; Two-handed &bull; Ranged &bull; Martial</em></strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>Accuracy: 【DEX】+【INS】+ 1 &bull;　Damage: 【HR + 5】Physical</em></strong></p>\n<blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-style: normal;\">You deal <strong>5</strong>&nbsp;<strong>bonus damage&nbsp;</strong>to creature with <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Fear.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.TOF8epes1eGHwx5J]{Frightened}</span></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>【Set Bonus】</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2 Piece</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>You deal <strong>10</strong> <strong>bonus damage&nbsp;</strong>to creature whose&nbsp;<strong>level&nbsp;</strong>is lower than you<br><hr></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3 Piece</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Creature whose&nbsp;<strong>level </strong>is lower than you start the&nbsp;<strong>conflict&nbsp;</strong>with <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Fear.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.TOF8epes1eGHwx5J]{Frightened} which last for&nbsp;<strong>1</strong> Round</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></p>\nERROR",
